{"decisions":[{"i":0,"decision":"F0","origin":"none","reason":"The excerpt accurately states the approval date, approving official, and three standard identifiers.","sourceEvidence":"The source says the Secretary of Commerce approved three standards in August 2024: FIPS 203, 204, and 205.","synthesisStatement":"The Secretary of Commerce approved FIPS 203, 204 and 205 in August 2024.","narrativeStatement":"The Secretary of Commerce approved FIPS 203, 204 and 205 in August 2024.","materiality":"No discrepancy."},{"i":1,"decision":"F0","origin":"none","reason":"The title’s distinction between two purposes is supported: FIPS 203 establishes a shared secret, while FIPS 204 and 205 specify digital signature schemes.","sourceEvidence":"The source describes FIPS 203 as a KEM for establishing a shared secret, and FIPS 204 and 205 as digital signature standards.","synthesisStatement":"FIPS 203 specifies ML-KEM to establish a shared secret between parties communicating over a public channel. FIPS 204 specifies a module-lattice-based digital signature scheme. FIPS 205 specifies a stateless hash-based digital signature scheme.","narrativeStatement":"The three standards therefore cover two functions: shared-secret establishment and digital signatures.","materiality":"No discrepancy."}]}

